  recipeId: sensor
  concept: 'Authored objective: Repair three independent sensor faults.

    Authored
    requirement: Repair the Camera B via, PPS trigger and LiDAR filter. Acquire fresh
    evidence after each.

    General teaching principle: Sensor outputs require
    proper calibration, reference and freshness before they can support a diagnosis.

    Only
    fresh, authoritative game evidence can establish that this objective is complete.'
  analogy: A measuring ruler is useful only if zero and units are correctly established.
  diagram: '[Authored setup] -> [Check prerequisites] -> [Observe the game evidence]
    -> [Verify objective]'
  misconception: An old, uncalibrated or missing sensor reading is not reliable evidence.
